    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We Yawe, bushe tewe wabako ukufumafye ku citendekelo. Niwe Lesa wandi, we wamushilo wandi, tatwakafwe iyoo. We Yawe, niwe wasala abena Babiloni kukucita ubupingushi. We cilibwe icasansuka, niwe wabapeela no bulamba pakuti baletukanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala amenso yobe yaliwamisha, teti uyalekefye yalelolekesha ifyabipa, kabili tekuti iwe uletambakofye uko abantu balelufyanya. Nga nomba cinshi icakuti iwe wikalefye tondolo, pa nshita ababifi balelofya abantu ababacila mu bololoke?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakuti walacita shani abantu kwati lisabi, kwati fishishi ifishakwata na wakufitungulula? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Babiloni baleikata abantu kwati lisabi balefwampula ku malobo. Balebakulila mu masumbu, baleaula no tupundu pa bupalu bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E mulandu wine aba bantu bapepela amasumbu yabo, no kulayafutumwina ububani, pantu mu masumbu yabo balamwenamo ifintu ifisuma nganshi ne fyakulya ifyakubasansamusha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe kwena bakulakonkanyapofye ukulaikata no kufumya mwisumbu lyabo, no kulalofya abantu ba mishobo imbi ukwabula no luse, mwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
